# Without the git stamp, the binary reports a version naming no commit it came from.

title: the version stamp names something other than the commit it was built from
file: Makefile
run: go test -count=1 -run TestBinaryPrintsTheCommitItWasBuiltFrom -v ./cmd/pacioli/
--- before
VERSION     ?= $(shell git describe --tags --always --dirty 2>/dev/null || echo dev)
--- after
VERSION     ?= totally-wrong
